  "contract": "Entering Blackrock Stadium (area trigger 2026) starts Lord Victor Nefarius' arena event. Rend summons one wave per creature_summon_groups group (0-5) and the next wave follows each cleared one, so all six waves arrive. After the last wave Rend rides out on Gyth. At a quarter of Gyth's health Rend is knocked off and joins the fight himself, using Ascension's kit for him (Rend 2102842 and Mortal Strike 2102846 among it), and both can be killed. The Summon Rend Blackhand spell (16328) the drake once cast does not exist in the CoA Spell.dbc, so the dismount must not depend on it.",
